abstract: >-
  Research code, configuration, tests and descriptive results of an independent exploratory
  study of how auxiliary patient-identity supervision changes 64-gene MultiTaskLasso panel
  selection and donor-held-out immune-cell classification in single-cell RNA-seq
  (88 individuals, four donor-disjoint folds).
